        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The certificate chain of an SECC is transmitted to the EVCC and the certificate chain of the EVCC is transmitted to the SECC to enable an authenticity check of the SECC and EVCC before a TLS connection is established (see above: in order to avoid man-in-the-middle attacks).",
