        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The certificate chain of a contract certificate is transmitted into the EVCC without a root CA certificate. This limits the transmission to 3 certificates (4 if a cross-certificate is included), but this also means, that the EV cannot verify its own contract certificate.",
